# Generated deliverables and samples
deliverables/
*.zip
*.pdf

# The canonical government template library is source, not generated output.
# Matched at any depth: the library actually lives at frontend/RealForms/, so a
# root-anchored pattern silently dropped new official forms (the ones already
# tracked had been force-added).
!**/RealForms/*.pdf

# Populated working copies produced by `npm run forms:demo` / `npm run forms:verify`
generated-filings-demo/
generated-filings-verified/


# The deliverables API route is source code, not generated output
!frontend/src/app/api/deliverables/
